<!doctype html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>تفعيل Authenticator</title><style>body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#081426;color:#edf4ff;font-family:Tahoma,Arial}.card{width:min(480px,calc(100% - 36px));padding:30px;border:1px solid #28415e;border-radius:22px;background:#10213a;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #0008}h1{margin:0 0 10px}p{color:#b9c7d8;line-height:1.8}input,button{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:13px;border-radius:10px;font-size:16px}input{background:#071322;color:#fff;border:1px solid #355574;margin-top:12px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:2px}button{margin-top:14px;border:0;background:#12b981;color:#042118;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.secret{padding:13px;background:#071322;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:2px;word-break:break-all}.error{color:#ff8f8f;margin-top:12px}</style></head><body><main class="card"><h1>تفعيل Authenticator مطلوب</h1><p>مرحبًا <%= principalName %>. لحماية حسابك، أضف المفتاح إلى تطبيق Authenticator ثم أدخل الرمز المكون من 6 أرقام. لن تتمكن من متابعة العمل قبل التفعيل.</p><button id="start">إظهار مفتاح التفعيل</button><div id="setup" hidden><p>المفتاح:</p><div class="secret" id="secret"></div><input id="token" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" placeholder="000000"><button id="confirm">تأكيد التفعيل</button></div><div class="error" id="error"></div></main><script>const csrf=<%- JSON.stringify(csrfToken) %>;let setup;const err=m=>document.getElementById('error').textContent=m;async function call(url,data){const r=await fetch(url,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','x-csrf-token':csrf},body:JSON.stringify(data||{})});const b=await r.json();if(!r.ok||!b.success)throw Error(b.error||'تعذر تنفيذ العملية.');return b}document.getElementById('start').onclick=async()=>{try{setup=await call('/security/mfa/setup');document.getElementById('secret').textContent=setup.setup.secret;document.getElementById('setup').hidden=false;document.getElementById('start').hidden=true}catch(e){err(e.message)}};document.getElementById('confirm').onclick=async()=>{try{await call('/security/mfa/confirm',{secret:setup.setup.secret,token:document.getElementById('token').value,recoveryCodes:setup.setup.recoveryCodes});location.href='/client/dashboard'}catch(e){err(e.message)}};</script></body></html>
